1,1,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning congestion is unacceptable. We need data on actual usage patterns to allocate spaces fairly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before discussing usage, we must understand the financial implications. What is the true cost of these spaces?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about historical bias. Have the same residents always secured the prime spots?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We should avoid creating a system that turns neighbors into rivals. Let’s look at past conflicts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I worry about who maintains this. The last two roles quietly lapsed. We need to know the workload.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, financials are secondary. The physical layout dictates the chaos. We need to see the rain exposure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, ignoring costs leads to debt. I will check the ledger. We need to know what we can afford.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I will review the five years of minutes. If bias exists, it will be recorded there.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I will check the complaint log. If people are already angry, a new rule will break the building.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I will look at the supplier’s frame trial. If it’s hard to install, it’s hard to keep running.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"The sticker register shows who actually rides. We need to match spaces to real users, not just residents.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Agreed. But if the sticker system costs money, we need to know if the building can pay for it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,The minutes will show if the current allocation was ever formally voted on or just assumed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If the complaints are about noise or theft, a rigid rule might make it worse. I need to see the tone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"If the frame requires monthly tightening, who does it? I don’t want to be the one with the wrench.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,We need to see the morning departures. Watching the flow will reveal where the bottleneck actually is.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will also check the treasurer’s file. Cash collections often hide the real operational costs of maintenance.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will also look at the neighboring block’s account. They solved this problem three years ago.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I will check the ward cycle park. If we can’t fit everyone here, maybe we shouldn’t try.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I will check the building account ledger. If we spend money on frames, we need to know if we have the budget.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
